# R: R Language Definition (R 4.x), 10.3 Tokens; requirements/languages/r.md
name     r

keyword  if else repeat while function for in next break
builtin  TRUE FALSE NULL Inf NaN NA NA_integer_ NA_real_ NA_character_ NA_complex_
builtin  c library require print cat paste paste0 length sum mean list vector matrix return invisible
builtin  stop warning

ident-extra    .
line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
string   ` `  : name
escape        : x=2 octal=3 u4 U8 u-braces
operators  +-*/^%&|!<>=:~$@
calls
